message: "If you use AWAIS X MD in your work or research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "AWAIS X MD"
abstract: >-
  AWAIS X MD is an open-source multi-device WhatsApp bot written in Node.js
  on the Baileys 6.7.18 library. It provides 167 commands in 12 categories
  (General, YouTube, Download, Student Lab, Developer Tools, Islamic, Awais
  Tools, Anti Features, Group, Fun, DPZ Lab, AI & More), Gemini AI chat and
  image generation, media downloaders, Islamic tools, anti-delete/anti-edit/
  anti-link and group management. It supports Telegram Bot mode and Terminal
  mode and can be installed on Termux, Ubuntu/Debian VPS (PM2), Windows, Linux
  and macOS. Unofficial project, not affiliated with WhatsApp or Meta.
authors:
